  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"prYNG\" id=\"prYNG\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a22febf\" id=\"u5a22febf\">机器狗移动原理</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc3d4b2d0\" id=\"uc3d4b2d0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u17591690\" id=\"u17591690\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6ddbe0d3\" id=\"u6ddbe0d3\"><span data-lake-id=\"uabe2d073\" id=\"uabe2d073\">控制舵机转动实现机器狗足端的移动</span></p><blockquote data-lake-id=\"udbbcb419\" id=\"udbbcb419\"><p data-lake-id=\"u48e5e829\" id=\"u48e5e829\"><span data-lake-id=\"u60d600d7\" id=\"u60d600d7\"> 重点:根据足端坐标获取两个舵机的转动角度</span></p></blockquote><h2 data-lake-id=\"D1TVM\" id=\"D1TVM\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud3241a88\" id=\"ud3241a88\">狗腿反解</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u5f581abc\" id=\"u5f581abc\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1697703230069-347e1fe4-1c77-49d9-bfb5-48cd249142a8.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ued506638-b2ef-4c71-8063-8cd6f48bb13%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u509b1fb8-98c1-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A436.3333435058594%2C%22height%22%3A263%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A519198%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1477%2C%22originHeight%22%3A890%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e2e1e5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ue988ab2f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5d3edced\" id=\"u5d3edced\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufca82dc6\" id=\"ufca82dc6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u94b59727\" id=\"u94b59727\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51)\">在当前的狗腿子中</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub5c6d55d\" id=\"ub5c6d55d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51)\">,</span><span data-lake-id=\"ude6218c8\" id=\"ude6218c8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51)\">我们其实是知道每个关节的长度的</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub447239d\" id=\"ub447239d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51)\">,</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf9aaeeb3\" id=\"uf9aaeeb3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51)\">现在我们其实要做的事情就是已知足端左表</span><span data-lake-id=\"u91af5335\" id=\"u91af5335\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51)\">(x,y) , </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf0302124\" id=\"uf0302124\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2fc8bff6\" id=\"u2fc8bff6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51)\">求解机械狗上面的舵机需要转动的角度. 这个该如何来进行求解呢?</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0f3c0635\" id=\"u0f3c0635\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41815fa1\" id=\"u41815fa1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51)\">为了便于大家学习, 我们先将机械狗模型简化为平面几何,如下图所示:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3a874686\" id=\"u3a874686\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1697703257495-05f55473-62b9-48a1-82a1-629bc5cf7a9e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u1bbb8475-55eb-470e-b231-868eabe03ab%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u509b1fb8-98c1-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A429.3333435058594%2C%22height%22%3A271%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A127881%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1123%2C%22originHeight%22%3A709%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%A7-68.0Y-210.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A617%2C%22y%22%3A583%2C%22width%22%3A434%2C%22height%22%3A78%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A242%2C%22y%22%3A86%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23eeeaea%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u90a024e1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8f446f94\" id=\"u8f446f94\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub6f95b8f\" id=\"ub6f95b8f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51)\">我们需要求出上图左表的夹角alpha, 右边的夹角为beta</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"jwg5A\" id=\"jwg5A\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf1db6922\" id=\"uf1db6922\">反解代码</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20__init__(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20super().__init__()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E6%A0%87%E9%A2%98%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.setWindowTitle('%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E7%8B%97%E7%BB%98%E5%88%B6')%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.setFixedSize(640%2C%20480)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20--------------%20%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E7%82%B9%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%20--------------%20%23%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.center_x%20%3D%20320%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.center_y%20%3D%20100%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%A4%A7%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%84%E7%BC%A9%E6%94%BE%E7%B3%BB%E6%95%B0%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.ratio%20%3D%204%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20--------------%20%E5%B7%B2%E7%9F%A5%E7%8B%97%E8%85%BF%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%20--------------%20%23%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.AF%20%3D%2012.5%20*%20self.ratio%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.AB%20%3D%2021.5%20*%20self.ratio%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.EF%20%3D%2021.5%20*%20self.ratio%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.CE%20%3D%2021.5%20*%20self.ratio%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.BC%20%3D%2034.19%20*%20self.ratio%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.CD%20%3D%2034.95%20*%20self.ratio%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20BC%E5%92%8CCD%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%B9%E8%A7%92%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.bcd_angle%20%3D%20math.radians(120)%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.half_AF%20%3D%20self.AF%20%2F%202%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20--------------%20%E5%90%84%E4%B8%AA%E7%AB%AF%E7%82%B9%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%20--------------%20%23%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.AX%20%3D%20-self.half_AF%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.AY%20%3D%200%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.FX%20%3D%20self.half_AF%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.FY%20%3D%200%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.BX%20%3D%200%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.BY%20%3D%200%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.CX%20%3D%200%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.CY%20%3D%200%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.EX%20%3D%200%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.EY%20%3D%200%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20--------------%20%E8%B6%B3%E7%AB%AF%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%20--------------%20%23%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.DX%20%3D%200%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.DY%20%3D%2060%20*%20self.ratio%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20--------------%20%E6%8C%89%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%20--------------%20%23%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.press_x%20%3D%20self.DX%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.press_y%20%3D%20self.DY%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20--------------%20alpha%E5%92%8Cbeta%20--------------%20%23%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.alpha%20%3D%200%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.beta%20%3D%200%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20--------------%20%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%E9%80%86%E8%A7%A3%20--------------%20%23%5Cn%20%20%20%20self.results%20%3D%20self.inverse(self.DX%2C%20self.DY)%5Cn%5Cndef%20inverse(self%2C%20fx%2C%20fy)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20AD%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%5Cn%20%20%20%20AD2%20%3D%20(self.half_AF%20%2B%20fx)%20**%202%20%2B%20fy%20**%202%5Cn%20%20%20%20AD%20%3D%20math.sqrt(AD2)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20DAF%E5%A4%B9%E8%A7%92%5Cn%20%20%20%20angle_DAF%20%3D%20math.asin(fy%20%2F%20AD)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20BD%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%5Cn%20%20%20%20BD2%20%3D%20self.BC%20**%202%20%2B%20self.CD%20**%202%20-%202%20*%20self.BC%20*%20self.CD%20*%20math.cos(self.bcd_angle)%5Cn%20%20%20%20BD%20%3D%20math.sqrt(BD2)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20BAD%E5%A4%B9%E8%A7%92%5Cn%20%20%20%20angle_BAD%20%3D%20math.acos((self.AB%20**%202%20%2B%20AD2%20-%20BD2)%20%2F%20(2%20*%20self.AB%20*%20AD))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20AB%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E7%9A%84alpha%E5%A4%B9%E8%A7%92%5Cn%20%20%20%20alpha%20%3D%20math.pi%20-%20angle_BAD%20-%20angle_DAF%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20angle_DBA%20%3D%20math.acos((self.AB%20**%202%20%2B%20BD2%20-%20AD2)%20%2F%20(2%20*%20self.AB%20*%20BD))%5Cn%20%20%20%20angle_DBC%2